// Native Goo is an engine-owned learnable A0FW/A4E9 pair. Register the
// actual face and leave its target mode/range to the native definitions.
// Rewriting the base while Engineering Upgrade replaces it gives two
// lifecycle owners to the same native command. Foreign OMG keeps its path.
if SuijiMode_IsNativeLearnableAghPair(u,'A0FW','A4E9') then
if SuijiMode_ScepterRegistryRefresh(u,'A0FW','A4E9',active,"") then
set changed=true
