// B762: the historical pool rows for Sleight of Fist and native Avalanche
// describe stale commands (berserk/blizzard), although both live objects use
// clusterrockets. Give only a conflicting random Sleight an impale carrier.
call SaveInteger(SUIJI_FIXED_CLONE_TABLE,2,'A2H0','YE1D')
